# test/remote/smoke.k4r -- a K4510 on another computer, after a deploy:
#     tools/k4510-remote run test/remote/smoke.k4r
# The prompt answers, BOOK opens its contents, Esc comes back to the prompt.
# (k4510-remote: type / key / expect TEXT [secs] / wait S / shot NAME / screen)
# the machine's own colours first: a STARTUP.BAT may load another palette (Doc, 2026-09-15)
type PALETTE RESET\n
wait 1
type BOOK\n
expect "The K4510 User's and Programmer's Guide" 15
shot book-contents
key esc
expect "/HOME]" 10
screen
